@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@companyAdminToken = cole_o_access_token_do_company_admin_aqui
@ruleId = cole_o_id_da_regra_aqui
@vehicleId = cole_o_id_do_veiculo_aqui
@employeeId = cole_o_id_do_funcionario_aqui

### Listar regras de manutencao
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}

### Criar regra por km
POST {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Troca de oleo",
  "type": "OIL_CHANGE",
  "intervalKm": 5000,
  "isActive": true
}

### Criar regra por data
POST {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rodizio de pneus",
  "type": "TIRES",
  "intervalDays": 90,
  "isActive": true
}

### Criar regra por data e km
POST {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Revisao preventiva",
  "type": "PREVENTIVE_REVIEW",
  "intervalKm": 10000,
  "intervalDays": 180,
  "isActive": true
}

### Atualizar regra
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/rules/{{ruleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalKm": 6000,
  "isActive": true
}

### Listar alertas de manutencao vencida
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}

### Listar manutencoes registradas com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/records?vehicleId={{vehicleId}}&employeeId={{employeeId}}&type=OIL_CHANGE&status=DONE&startDate=2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2026-05-31T23:59:59.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}

### Registrar manutencao realizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/company/maintenance/records
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "maintenanceRuleId": "{{ruleId}}",
  "type": "OIL_CHANGE",
  "description": "Troca de oleo e filtro",
  "performedAt": "2026-05-15T12:00:00.000Z",
  "performedKm": 50000,
  "cost": 280,
  "status": "DONE"
}

### Historico de manutencao por veiculo
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
